## Every suite's tooling, all required. A missing dependency is a hard FAIL at
## run time, never a SKIP -- a coverage or regression gate that quietly stops
## gating because a package is absent is the failure mode this whole suite set
## exists to close. So the package must GUARANTEE the tooling is there rather
## than degrade around it. Only an absent SUBJECT (the component checkout under
## test) earns 77 SKIP.
