Description: Comprehensive regression, fuzz and integration suites for Kicksecure tooling
 The AI-maintained test surface for the derivative-maker ecosystem: regression,
 fuzz, end-to-end and integration suites for helper-scripts, developer-meta-files,
 privleap, onion-grater, secure-terminal, systemcheck, tor-control-panel,
 sdwdate-gui, msgcollector, tb-updater, pyte and more, plus the orchestrator that
 runs them and the static gate that lints them.
 .
 The suites live here rather than in each component repo because they are far too
 high-volume for human review in a repo whose diffs a maintainer reads. Each one
 targets a CHECKOUT of the component it tests, wired by dist-ai-tests-all via
 --component / --component-root, which is also how per-repo CI invokes them.
 .
 Start with 'dist-ai-tests-all --list' to see every registered suite and its
 category. A suite whose subject or tooling is absent exits 77 and is reported
 SKIP, never FAIL, so a partial install is usable: install the Suggests matching
 the suites you actually intend to run.
